{
  "_comment": "Evaluation task battery for eval_checkpoint.py. checkpoint.RUN_NAME is required; checkpoint.MODEL_FILE is optional and defaults to the newest model*.pt; checkpoint.OUTPUT_DIR is optional and names the run folder the results are written under (a bare name goes under outputs/eval_checkpoint/, default RUN_NAME; <MODEL_NAME> is appended either way). Each task is {category, args}, where args are extra generate.py flags. Path-valued flags (--reference_motion, --cond_path) accept an absolute path or a path relative to the Anytop dir; \"$LAST_OUTPUT\" resolves to the first output .npy of the previous task. A task without --action_label must set eval_label (the action of its reference clip); it is only used to pick the reference prior the clips are scored against.",
  "checkpoint": {
